cceptance on the face of the deed. The question that acceptance has not been proved was raised when written submissions were filed but this is too belated to be entertained Quaere : Is the protocol of a deed kept by the attesting Notary an original document in terms of the Evidence Ordinance ?",,none,headnote,ratio,high,headnote,unverified
