scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\cache\courts-sc-sc_appeal_158_2013.pdf.json:7:   "statement": "A Notary Public who attested a Deed cannot be regarded as an attesting witness for the purposes of Section 68 of the Evidence Ordinance if he does not know the executant of the Deed.",
