scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\cache\courts-sc-sc_appeal_218_2016.pdf.json:8:   "supporting_quote": "According to section 58 of the Evidence Ordinance such formal admissions recorded at the trial need no further proof unless the Court wants them to be proved.",
