scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\cache\courts-sc-sc_appeal_36_2014.pdf.json:8:   "supporting_quote": "However, if the deed is impeached or challenged through an issue raised, it has to be proved as per the provisions of Evidence Ordinance.",
